5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm really worried about how this will actually work in the yards. I'll check the Depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and the Yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to ensure we aren't surprised by hidden costs later. I'll look into the Board minutes on capital and operating requests and the Five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'm concerned about accountability and scope creep. I'll examine the Support ownership during last winter's outage and the Warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see if things just get old or if outside help actually works! I'll check the Upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the Data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
